[B]1.10.1[/B] - 2021-06-03
Removed startup message.

[B]1.10.0[/B] - 2021-06-02
Updated for Blackwood, including a new keybind for Endeavors.

Known issue: The Dungeon Finder and Battlegrounds keybinds select the wrong entry in the navigation list of the group window. There doesn't seem to be anything I can do about it, though.

[B]1.9.0[/B] - 2021-04-17
Updated for Flames of Ambition.

Added the following keybinds:

[LIST]
[*]Collections > Sets
[*]Quest Journal > Antiquities
[/LIST]
Additionally, the [I]Focus primary search box[/I] keybind is now also supported in the following locations:

[LIST]
[*]Main Menu > Addons (with Circonians Addon Selector)
[*]Main Menu > Controls (with Votan's Keybinder)
[*]Main Menu > Settings > Addons
[/LIST]
Also fixed the following bugs:

[LIST]
[*]Fixed focusing primary search box in quick slots.
[*]Fixed switching between champion point constellations.
[/LIST]

[B]1.8.0[/B] - 2020-05-29
Updated for Greymoor.

[B]1.7.0[/B] - 2020-05-17
Subtab switching is now supported in most windows using these new keybinds:

[LIST]
[*]Tabs > Show next subtab
[*]Tabs > Show previous subtab
[/LIST]
Additionally, the [I]Focus primary search box[/I] keybind is now also supported in the following locations:

[LIST]
[*]Outfit Station > Equipment
[*]Outfit Station > Costume and Hat
[*]Trading House (Guild Store) > Browse (without AwesomeGuildStore)
[/LIST]

[B]1.6.0[/B] - 2020-05-16
Added support for switching between champion point constellations with the [I]Show next tab[/I] and [I]Show previous tab[/I] keybinds.

[B]1.5.0[/B] - 2020-05-12
You can now use the [I]Show next tab[/I] and [I]Show previous tab[/I] keybinds in a lot more places.

I have also added the following new keybinds:

[LIST]
[*]Chat > Toggle chat window
[*]Miscellaneous > Focus primary search box
[*]Miscellaneous > Travel to primary house
[/LIST]
You can read more about the new features in the add-on's [URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info2608-AenathelsKeybinds.html"]description[/URL].

[B]1.4.2[/B] - 2020-05-10
The startup message will now [I]actually[/I] only be printed once per login. Sorry about that!

[B]1.4.1[/B] - 2020-05-09
The startup message will now only be printed once per login.

[B]1.4.0[/B] - 2020-05-05
Removed "nonessential" keybinds to prevent hitting the ESO keybindings shadow limit.

I hate having to do this, but I would rather do it now, when it doesn't impact as many people, than later.

The following keybinds were removed:

[B]Chat keybinds[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Write in Emote
[*]Write in Say
[*]Write in Yell
[*]Write in Zone - English
[*]Write in Zone - French
[*]Write in Zone - German
[*]Write in Zone - Japanese
[*]Write in Officer 1 to 5
[/LIST]
[B]Tabs keybinds[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Alliance War > Overview
[*]Alliance War > Campaigns
[*]Collections > Collectibles
[*]Collections > Stories
[*]Collections > Housing
[*]Collections > Outfit Styles
[*]Friends > Friends
[*]Friends > Ignored
[*]Group > Zone Guide
[*]Guilds > Ranks
[*]Guilds > Recruitment
[*]Guilds > Heraldry
[*]Guilds > History
[*]Help > Tutorials
[*]Help > Customer Support
[*]Help > Emotes
[*]Inventory > Quickslots
[*]Journal > Cadwell's Almanac
[*]Journal > Lore Library
[*]Journal > Leaderboards
[*]Mail > Inbox
[*]Mail > Send
[*]Map > Key
[*]Map > Filters
[*]Map > Locations
[/LIST]
I hope to find a way to support them later, if nothing else then by getting ZOS to increase or remove the keybindings shadow limit.

[B]1.3.0[/B] - 2020-05-03
- Tab switching in the Crown Store panel now works reliably.

[B]1.2.1[/B] - 2020-05-03
- Fixed a bug that could occur when switching from certain panels to inventory or map tabs.

[B]1.2.0[/B] - 2020-05-03
- The inventory and map tabs are now supported.

[B]1.1.0[/B] - 2020-05-02
- The add-on now enables chording so Ctrl/Alt/Shift/Command can be used in keybinds. This allows keybinds like Ctrl+B, Ctrl+Shift+B, or even Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B.
